# Intermediate Teamwork (sandoria 64) with its era module (quest rework B3b, Task 9): five Humes in a party of six. The
# module (xi.pre(xi.expansion.ROV): RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_ROV 0) needs six of main's kind (same-race count >= 6);
# fay is an Elvaan male (race 3): #party 6 passes, the count is 5, updateEvent(4, 2) (the quest's own: 15, 2); finish
# option 0 with the local Prog 0: nothing.
module modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/intermediate_teamwork.lua
lists WestRonfaure/Vilatroire/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventUpdate/129 WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/129
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,423.42 job=WAR race=1 lvl=10
char bob zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,428 job=WAR race=2 lvl=10
char carl zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,426 job=WAR race=1 lvl=10
char dave zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,421 job=WAR race=2 lvl=10
char eve zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,426 job=WAR race=1 lvl=10
char fay zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,421 job=WAR race=3 lvl=10
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
quest Sandoria.IntroductionToTeamwork completed
quest Sandoria.IntermediateTeamwork accepted
login
bob: login
carl: login
dave: login
eve: login
fay: login
invite bob
bob: accept
invite carl
carl: accept
invite dave
dave: accept
invite eve
eve: accept
invite fay
fay: accept                               # six: five Humes, fay an Elvaan
trigger Vilatroire                        # 129 { [1] = 2 }
update 129 option=0                       # #party 6; five Humes (below 6): updateEvent(4, 2)
finish                                    # option 0, the local Prog 0: nothing
